// offline-exam-plan-right.bml — the right function beside the plan exam's wrong one (learn/offline-exam-plan-target.bml): the grader reads the voice's band over this file, so a band that cannot tell them apart fails its key. The exam's request never names it.
section [form.bml] {
 class OfflineExamPlanRight {
  def oept-double(x) = 2 * x;
 }
 0;
}
